Closed-Loop IoT Pipeline Verification:
1. ESP32 reads POT ADC (GPIO34): Raw=2048 (1.65V)
2. ESP32 streams JSON over UART -> Kestrel Gateway
3. Kestrel updates Calibration Engine -> Calculates Display Bitmap
4. Kestrel dispatches commands -> ESP32 SPI OLED SSD1306
Round-Trip Latency: 24 ms.
Display Status: In-sync with physical potentiometer wiper position.
